Countryfied funk with this super cool pedal from @xoticeffectspedals which is a volume pedal with the legendary EP Booster built-in! For the rhythm guitars I’m using the EP Booster to add some grit to a clean Divided by 13 FTR 37. And for the lead and slide I’m boosting a pushed FTR37 to take it to the next level! You can also hear to nice volume sweep on the slide guitar! Drum break brought to you by @ajhall89 ‍ #guitar #guitarist #guitarsolo #countryguitar #xotic<p><img src="https://prank-arum.github.io/Feeds/Instagram/erikholmbomguitar/6754134752243043664327.jpg"><p><a href="https://picnob.com/post/6754134752243043664327">Original post on Picnob</a>]]>
